    {
      "BoatModelID": "SEAL-34-TC",
      "Field": "ResearchNotes",
      "Old": "Canonical name refined from Sealord 34 Tri-Cabin to Sealord 34 Double Cabin Trawler, with Tri-Cabin retained as an alias. A verified 1987 Ontario listing identifies the boat as a Sealord (Chien Hwa) Trawler at 34', 12' beam, 3'6\" draft, 18,000 lb and twin Volvo MD31A 63-hp diesels. A 1986 Sea Lord listing reports 34', 11'9\" beam, ~16,000 lb, twin Volvo MD30A 65-hp diesels, 200 gal fuel and 100 gal water. B-Atlas uses the directly documented 1987 dimensions and representative 200/100 gal tankage; exact builder/model equivalence with CHB remains unresolved.\n\nBatch 33 confidence audit: exact-model identity and source quality rechecked. Confidence is intentionally retained where factory/importer documentation is incomplete; missing evidence does not trigger deletion or inferred consolidation.",
      "New": "Canonical name refined from Sealord 34 Tri-Cabin to Sealord 34 Double Cabin Trawler, with Tri-Cabin retained as an alias. A verified 1987 Ontario listing identifies the boat as a Sealord (Chien Hwa) Trawler at 34', 12' beam, 3'6\" draft, 18,000 lb and twin Volvo MD31A 63-hp diesels. A 1986 Sea Lord listing reports 34', 11'9\" beam, ~16,000 lb, twin Volvo MD30A 65-hp diesels, 200 gal fuel and 100 gal water. B-Atlas uses the directly documented 1987 dimensions and representative 200/100 gal tankage; exact builder/model equivalence with CHB remains unresolved.\n\nBatch 33 confidence audit: exact-model identity and source quality rechecked. Confidence is intentionally retained where factory/importer documentation is incomplete; missing evidence does not trigger deletion or inferred consolidation. Batch 14 final-tail review: exact 1986/1987 surviving examples continue to support 34 ft class dimensions and twin Volvo diesels. Exact 1986 listing gives 757/378/94 L capacities, consistent with approximately 200/100/25 US gal. LWL, air draft and rudder subtype remain unverified.",
      "Basis": "Append Batch 14 provenance summary.",
      "EvidenceRefs": [
        "https://dailyboats.com/boat/309289-buy-sea-lord-34-double-cabin-trawler-for-sale",
        "https://www.boatdealers.ca/boats-for-sale/542099/sealord-tricabin-hamilton-ontario"
      ]
    },
